{"id": "unknown-2026-08-12-004", "date": "2026-08-12", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 33, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Colombia: Earthquake affects power grid, but no damage reported at solar plants", "content": "<p>A magnitude-7.4 earthquake in Colombia disrupted electricity supplies, leaving up to 20% of demand unmet in some affected regions. No damage has been reported at utility-scale solar plants, with the main impacts concentrated on transmission and distribution infrastructure.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/12/colombia-earthquake-affects-power-grid-but-no-damage-reported-at-solar-plants/\">Colombia: Earthquake affects power grid, but no damage reported at solar plants", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/12/colombia-earthquake-affects-power-grid-but-no-damage-reported-at-solar-plants/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-12-005", "date": "2026-08-12", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 33, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "US eases transport rules for portable lithium batteries, raising limits and cutting regulation", "content": "<p>The shift to battery-powered tools and portable power stations in the trades has been hampered by hazardous materials regulations set before the battery revolution. A new US ruling better clears the way for the portable storage industry. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/12/us-eases-transport-rules-for-portable-lithium-batteries-raising-limits-and-cutting-regulation/\">US eases transport rules for portable lithium batteries, raising limits and cutting regulation</a>", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/12/us-eases-transport-rules-for-portable-lithium-batteries-raising-limits-and-cutting-regulation/", "type": "rss"}]}
